Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

BlazeRod renderer (package top.fifthlight.blazerod)
    The rendering core of this project (glTF loading, GPU layouts, render graph, animation runtime) is a port of the
    BlazeRod renderer by FifthLight, used as the rendering layer of the ArmorStand project. It is licensed under the
    GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 or later.
    Ported code lives under src/main/kotlin/top/fifthlight/blazerod/, with the BOM-free glue in
    com.huashanlunjian.glbrender. Modifications made for this project include: a backend seam that removes all
    Minecraft types from the core (GlbBackend), a Minecraft-side sampler/texture binding layer, batching/instancing,
    PBR/unlit material variants, and the NPC/editor on top.

Khronos glTF Sample Models
    test-models/CesiumMan.glb is "CesiumMan" by Cesium, distributed with the Khronos glTF Sample Models under
    Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC-BY 4.0).
    test-models/InterpolationTest.glb is from the same Khronos sample set.

Assimp (tools/assimp/win/Release/assimp-vc143-mt.dll)
    A prebuilt binary of the Open Asset Import Library (assimp), used only by the development-time FBX conversion
    helper. Assimp is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause license; see the assimp project for details.

CustomNPCs
    The NPC editor's layout and feature set were designed after CustomNPCs. This project contains no CustomNPCs
    source code and does not link against it at runtime.
